## Event ID Cheat Sheet

| Event ID | Meaning | Related Attack |
|---|---|---|
| 4768 | Kerberos TGT requested | Kerberoasting recon |
| 4769 | Service ticket requested | Kerberoasting |
| 4776 | NTLM authentication attempt | Pass-the-Hash |
| 4624 | Successful logon | PtH (check Logon Type 3) |
| 4625 | Failed logon | Brute force / PtH failure |
| 4728 | User added to security group | Privilege escalation |
| 4732 | User added to local admin group | Privilege escalation |
| 4756 | User added to universal group | Domain escalation |

